`Object3D.pivot` is a new property (rotation pivot), default `null`? Apparently. But I named my group `this.pivot` on the RubiksCube — colliding with the built-in `Object3D.pivot` property! The built-in expects a Vector3 (pivot point for rotation), and I set a THREE.Group. Then `updateMatrix` uses `pivot.x, pivot.y, pivot.z` — Group has no `.x`, so `undefined` → NaN translation. That's the bug!

